    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 1. Your search\n**Edit `Your search`, then Run now.**\n\n- `keywords`: comma-separated phrases your creators post about\n- `date_posted`: last-week, last-month or last-year\n- `min_followers` / `max_followers`: the size you can afford\n- `countries`: e.g. `United States, United Kingdom` (blank = any)\n- `only_with_email`: drop creators with no public email",
